# Obsidian per-machine / volatile state — keep out of Git.
# The `**/` prefix matches a `.obsidian/` folder at any depth, so this works
# whether the vault root is `docs/` or `docs/project-management/`.
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/.obsidian/cache/
**/.trash/

# Installed community-plugin code and Obsidian's property-type cache are
# per-machine / regenerated, so they stay out of Git.
**/.obsidian/plugins/
**/.obsidian/types.json

# Shareable config — the enabled-plugin list (community-plugins.json), app.json,
# and appearance.json — stays tracked so the vault setup travels with the repo.
# Add `**/.obsidian/` here if you'd rather keep all editor settings local.
